{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And he brought</b> — it is written <i>and some of the vessels of the house of Elohim</i>, for in the exile of Jehoiachin the precious vessels of the house of YHWH were brought to Babylon, as it is written <i>and the treasuries of the house of YHWH and the treasuries of the king's house</i>."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {0 "The lemma head 'ויתן' in the Hebrew note appears to be an error; the comment explains the phrase 'ומקצת כלי בית אלהים' from the verse. Translated the lemma as given."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:48.163887558Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}